snippet `(b|p|v)mata([1-9])` "matrix with equal elements" iAm
\\begin{``rv = m[1]``matrix*}[r]``
	let len = m[2];
	let results = "";
	for (var i=0; i<len; i++){
		results += "$1 &".repeat(len-1) + " $1 \\\\\\\\";
	}
	rv = results;
``\\end{``rv = m[1]``matrix*}$0
endsnippet

